---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title='Trouvus | AI Transformation Strategy and Implementation' description='Trouvus turns AI ambition into operating capability through strategy, business-model innovation, implementation design and workforce transformation.'>
<section class="hero"><canvas class="hero-canvas" data-variant="network"></canvas><div class="wrap hero-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow">AI transformation strategy and implementation</div><h1>Turn AI ambition into operating capability.</h1><p class="lead">We redesign enterprise strategy, workflows and workforce capabilities around AI—moving beyond pilots to deliver measurable operating results.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn accent" href="/contact/">Book an executive consultation</a><a class="btn secondary" href="/approach/">Explore the Strategy-to-Scale Framework</a></div></div><div class="hero-mark" aria-hidden="true"><div class="orb a"></div><div class="orb b"></div><div class="orb c"></div><div class="node n1"></div><div class="node n2"></div><div class="node n3"></div><div class="line l1"></div><div class="line l2"></div></div></div></section>
<section class="rule">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">The 2026 enterprise reality</div>
    <h2>Individual AI gains are rising. Enterprise value still depends on operating redesign.</h2>
    <div class="stat-grid">
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="kicker">McKinsey Global Survey · August 2026</div>
        <div class="stat-number">80%</div>
        <p class="muted small">of respondents say AI has improved their individual productivity.</p>
        <a class="source-link" href="https://www.mckinsey.com/capabilities/quantumblack/our-insights/the-state-of-ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read the 2026 survey →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="kicker">McKinsey Global Survey · August 2026</div>
        <div class="stat-number">37%</div>
        <p class="muted small">report that AI has contributed positively to their organization’s EBIT, despite broader enterprise scaling.</p>
        <a class="source-link" href="https://www.mckinsey.com/capabilities/quantumblack/our-insights/the-state-of-ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener">See the enterprise-impact findings →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="kicker">McKinsey Global Survey · August 2026</div>
        <div class="stat-number">6%</div>
        <p class="muted small">qualify as AI high performers, reporting significant value and at least 5% EBIT impact from AI.</p>
        <a class="source-link" href="https://www.mckinsey.com/capabilities/quantumblack/our-insights/the-state-of-ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Review what high performers do differently →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:14px">Based on 1,719 survey participants across 97 nations; fielded May–June 2026.</p>
    <div class="grid-3" style="margin-top:26px"><div class="card"><img class="icon" src="/images/icon-strategy.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt=""><h3>Disconnected strategy</h3><p class="muted">Tools deployed without clear business-model integration.</p></div><div class="card"><img class="icon" src="/images/icon-bizmodel.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt=""><h3>Unchanged workflows</h3><p class="muted">Automation layered over outdated operating processes.</p></div><div class="card"><img class="icon" src="/images/icon-workforce.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt=""><h3>Atrophied capability</h3><p class="muted">Workforce skills replaced rather than augmented.</p></div></div>
  </div>
</section>
<section><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">The transformation journey</div><h2>Three moves. One operating system.</h2><div class="stepper"><div class="stepper-tabs"><button class="stepper-tab active" data-tab="1">01 Decide</button><button class="stepper-tab" data-tab="2">02 Design &amp; deploy</button><button class="stepper-tab" data-tab="3">03 Adopt &amp; scale</button></div><div class="stepper-panel active" data-panel="1"><div><h3>Decide where AI creates defensible value</h3><p class="muted">Identify the opportunities that matter, prioritize them against value, feasibility, risk and readiness, and build a credible transformation roadmap.</p><a class="card-cta" href="/expertise/#strategy">AI strategy and roadmaps →</a></div><img src="/images/icon-strategy.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="" width="110" height="110"></div><div class="stepper-panel" data-panel="2"><div><h3>Redesign the work, then deploy</h3><p class="muted">Redesign business models, decisions and workflows; define bounded pilots; govern implementation against measurable outcomes.</p><a class="card-cta" href="/expertise/#implementation">Implementation and pilots →</a></div><img src="/images/icon-implementation.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="" width="110" height="110"></div><div class="stepper-panel" data-panel="3"><div><h3>Build the organization that scales it</h3><p class="muted">Develop leadership alignment, workforce capability, governance and the operating disciplines required to scale beyond the pilot.</p><a class="card-cta" href="/expertise/#workforce">Workforce transformation →</a></div><img src="/images/icon-workforce.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="" width="110" height="110"></div></div></div></section>
<section class="rule"><div class="wrap"><div class="split"><div><div class="eyebrow">Our point of view</div><h2>Transformation must redesign the system—not simply add tools.</h2><img src="/images/pov-steps.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Four moves: strategic value, redesign work, build capability, measure outcomes" width="620" height="190" style="margin-top:34px;background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;padding:8px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)"></div><div class="grid-2"><div class="card"><img class="icon" src="/images/icon-strategy.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt=""><h3>Start with strategic value</h3><p class="muted">Technology selection follows opportunity prioritization, operating logic and evidence.</p></div><div class="card"><img class="icon" src="/images/icon-bizmodel.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt=""><h3>Redesign work</h3><p class="muted">AI should improve decisions, workflows and value creation—not merely accelerate isolated tasks.</p></div><div class="card"><img class="icon" src="/images/icon-workforce.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt=""><h3>Build capability</h3><p class="muted">Every pilot should strengthen leadership judgment, workforce competence and institutional learning.</p></div><div class="card"><img class="icon" src="/images/icon-implementation.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt=""><h3>Measure outcomes</h3><p class="muted">Success is assessed through operating, strategic and organizational results rather than activity.</p></div></div></div></div></section>
<section><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Strategy-to-Scale Framework</div><h2>From strategic uncertainty to scalable capability.</h2><div class="pipeline"><div class="pipe-node" tabindex="0"><span class="tip">Uncover true capability constraints across data, tech and governance.</span><img class="stage-icon" src="/images/stage-diagnose.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt=""><div class="num">01</div><h3>Diagnose</h3></div><div class="pipe-node" tabindex="0"><span class="tip">Convert fragmented use-case lists into a ranked, governed portfolio.</span><img class="stage-icon" src="/images/stage-prioritize.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt=""><div class="num">02</div><h3>Prioritize</h3></div><div class="pipe-node" tabindex="0"><span class="tip">Define workflows, decision rights and Human-Augmented boundaries.</span><img class="stage-icon" src="/images/stage-design.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt=""><div class="num">03</div><h3>Design</h3></div><div class="pipe-node" tabindex="0"><span class="tip">Run bounded tests with strict scale-or-stop decision rules.</span><img class="stage-icon" src="/images/stage-pilot.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt=""><div class="num">04</div><h3>Pilot</h3></div><div class="pipe-node" tabindex="0"><span class="tip">Institutionalize processes, controls and continuous workforce learning.</span><img class="stage-icon" src="/images/stage-scale.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt=""><div class="num">05</div><h3>Scale</h3></div></div><p class="small muted" style="margin-top:14px">Hover or focus each stage for its executive output. <a href="/approach/" style="color:var(--accent);font-weight:700">Full framework →</a></p></div></section>
<section class="rule"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Intellectual assets</div><h2>Frameworks that make transformation decisions visible.</h2><div class="grid-3"><div class="card tactile glass"><img src="/images/readiness-diagnostic.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="AI Transformation Readiness Diagnostic" width="640" height="300" style="border-radius:14px;margin-bottom:14px"><h3>AI Transformation Readiness Diagnostic</h3><p>Assesses strategic alignment, data, technology, governance and workforce capability.</p></div><div class="card tactile glass"><img src="/images/habmc.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Human-Augmented Business Model Canvas" width="640" height="300" style="border-radius:14px;margin-bottom:14px"><h3>Human-Augmented Business Model Canvas</h3><p>Examines how AI changes value creation while preserving critical human agency.</p></div><div class="card tactile glass"><img src="/images/strategy-to-scale.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Strategy-to-Scale Framework" width="640" height="300" style="border-radius:14px;margin-bottom:14px"><h3>Pilot Passport</h3><p>Defines a pilot’s hypothesis, scope, owners, controls, metrics and scale decision.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section><div class="wrap split"><div><div class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--coral)">Measurable operating impact</div><h2>Designed for impact. Governed for certainty.</h2><p class="lead">We bridge research-backed strategic rigor with practical, metrics-driven implementation.</p><img src="/images/control-center.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Trouvus transformation diagnostic: five-dimension readiness radar and live portfolio view" width="640" height="460" style="border-radius:20px;margin-top:26px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)"></div><div><div class="card proof"><div class="badge violet">Research-grounded methodology</div><h3>Academic rigor, enterprise scale</h3><p class="muted">Built on peer-reviewed research and proven business-model frameworks—eliminating reliance on vendor hype or guesswork.</p></div><div class="card proof"><div class="badge green">Governed execution</div><h3>Pre-committed pilot metrics</h3><p class="muted">Every initiative operates under a Pilot Passport with explicit hypotheses, risk controls, and clear scale-or-stop milestones.</p></div><div class="card proof"><div class="badge amber">Capability retention</div><h3>Human agency at the core</h3><p class="muted">Systems engineered to automate routine toil while expanding internal leadership judgment and institutional expertise.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section><div class="wrap"><div class="cta"><div><div class="eyebrow">Executive consultation</div><h2>Identify where AI can create defensible business value.</h2><p class="muted">Begin with a focused discussion of your strategic priorities, operating constraints and transformation readiness.</p></div><a class="btn accent" href="/contact/">Book a consultation</a></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
